Analyze the numbers of parthenogenetic and non‑parthenogenetic offspring using Fisher’s exact test (for low counts) or a chi‑squared test (for higher incidences). Example R code: 
TBL <- rbind(c(sample_positives, sample_negatives), c(control_positives, control_negatives));
 fisher.test(TBL) # or chisq.test(TBL).
